---
// Tarjeta "Infraestructura Técnica" con consola estilo VS Code
---

<section class="py-8 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[#0B0F1A] p-8 md:p-12">
      
      <!-- Título fuera de la consola -->
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8 text-center tracking-wide">
        INFRAESTRUCTURA TÉCNICA
      </h2>

      <!-- Consola estilo VS Code -->
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-700 shadow-2xl">
        
        <!-- Badge "stable" en esquina superior derecha -->
        <div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10">
          <span class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-semibold bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 border border-green-500/30 rounded">
            stable
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Barra superior estilo macOS -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 bg-[#1a1f2e] border-b border-gray-700">
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500"></div>
          <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
          <span class="ml-4 text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono">infraestructura.yml</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Contenido YAML con sintaxis -->
        <div class="p-6 font-mono text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed bg-[#0B0F1A]">
          <pre class="m-0 p-0"><span class="text-[#E8530E]">software:</span> <span class="text-gray-300">"100% libre y open source"</span>
<span class="text-[#E8530E]">privacidad:</span> <span class="text-gray-300">"Sin trackers, sin algoritmos, sin dependencia"</span>
<span class="text-[#E8530E]">resiliencia:</span> <span class="text-gray-300">"Funciona offline, en zonas sin conectividad"</span>
<span class="text-[#E8530E]">stack:</span>
  <span class="text-green-400">-</span> <span class="text-gray-300">Astro</span>
  <span class="text-green-400">-</span> <span class="text-gray-300">Tailwind CSS</span>
  <span class="text-green-400">-</span> <span class="text-gray-300">PWA (offline-first)</span>
<span class="text-[#E8530E]">notificaciones:</span> <span class="text-gray-300">"VAPID soberanas"</span>
<span class="text-[#E8530E]">feed:</span> <span class="text-gray-300">"RSS open source"</span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>